{
  "title": { "zh": "设计测试集", "en": "Design a test set" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "在<level-ref to=\"0B2\"></level-ref>里，检查台检验的是别人的论断，样例是现成的。这一关方向反过来：由检查台替一个杯子分类器设计检验，从一批拍杯子的样例里挑出一组测试集。",
        "en": "In <level-ref to=\"0B2\"></level-ref> the station judged someone else's claim against cases already given. This level turns the other way: the station designs the test for a mug classifier, picking a test set out of a batch of photos of a mug."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的问题是：要检验它的<wiki-ref to=\"robustness\"></wiki-ref>，测试集里该放哪些样例？看每张样例和一张普通的正面照比变了什么：视角、光照，还是有东西挡在杯子前面。选出的一组要把这三种变化都覆盖到。",
        "en": "This level asks: to test its <wiki-ref to=\"robustness\"></wiki-ref>, which cases belong in the test set? See what each case changes against a plain front view: the viewpoint, the light, or something standing in front of the mug. The set you choose must cover all three changes."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0B3",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "选出一组样例，让它覆盖换视角、换光照和有东西挡在前面三种变化。",
        "en": "Choose a set of cases that covers a changed viewpoint, changed lighting and something standing in front."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "几张几乎一样的照片只算检验了一种情况；一张照片也可能同时变了两样。",
          "en": "Several near-identical photos test only one situation; one photo may change two things at once."
        }
      ],
      "judge": { "cover": { "needs": ["view", "light", "occlusion"] } },
